  "captionText": "WEBVTT\n\nSTT1\n00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.260\nWe start where these two lines cross. That is our initial equilibrium.\n\nSTT2\n00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:15.440\nNow demand increases. It moves from the blue line to the purple line, while supply stays put.\n\nSTT3\n00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:24.000\nThe new equilibrium is here. Both of these values are higher than before.\n\nSTT4\n00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:34.120\nThis is a shift of demand, not a movement along the original demand curve.\n\nSTT5\n00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:46.000\nIn the highlighted version, this whole top part is divided by this bottom part. The brackets are important.\n\nSTT6\n00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:53.700\nReturning to our original picture, this is the starting point again.\n",
  "raw": {
    "language_code": "eng",
    "language_probability": 1,
    "text": "We start where these two lines cross. That is our initial equilibrium. Now demand increases. It moves from the blue line to the purple line, while supply stays put. The new equilibrium is here. Both of these values are higher than before. This is a shift of demand, not a movement along the original demand curve. In the highlighted version, this whole top part is divided by this bottom part. The brackets are important. Returning to our original picture, this is the starting point again.",
